174
00:07:47,974 --> 00:07:50,455
One more thing. Real Miami was founded

175
00:07:50,505 --> 00:07:53,497
on July twenty-eighth, eighteen ninety-six. It is

176
00:07:53,547 --> 00:07:55,807
